            "detailed_description": "Play a classic Shoot 'Em Up... in reverse! Navigate deadly enemy waves and un-fire attacks in Retro/Grade, a mind-bending rhythm game by 24 Caret Games. Pick up a gamepad or a guitar controller and help Rick Rocket restore the continuity of space-time, before a temporal anomaly rips the universe a new time-hole!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with a gamepad, keyboard, or a guitar controller, and control the flow of time with the Retro/Rocket to undo your mistakes.<br></li><li>10 dazzling worlds with unique enemies, epic boss fights, and amazing effects.<br></li><li>A campaign with 6 difficulties, 130 different challenges, over 50 minutes of original music, and dozens of unlockable ships and rewards.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Play a classic Shoot 'Em Up... in reverse! Navigate deadly enemy waves and un-fire attacks in Retro/Grade, a mind-bending rhythm game by 24 Caret Games. Pick up a gamepad or a guitar controller and help Rick Rocket restore the continuity of space-time, before a temporal anomaly rips the universe a new time-hole!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with a gamepad, keyboard, or a guitar controller, and control the flow of time with the Retro/Rocket to undo your mistakes.<br></li><li>10 dazzling worlds with unique enemies, epic boss fights, and amazing effects.<br></li><li>A campaign with 6 difficulties, 130 different challenges, over 50 minutes of original music, and dozens of unlockable ships and rewards.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Joga um Shoot 'Em Up clássico... ao contrário!",
